  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A nimble defender reacts to a failed Dexterity save by rerolling and keeping the higher result. The character must be the creature making the save, and the triggering caster must be hostile.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
